# Component Selection

## LM555 Timer
Chosen for:
- Stable astable operation
- Wide supply voltage range
- Sufficient output drive for digital logic clock input

## SN74HC00 NAND Gate
Used for:
- Clock gating / signal conditioning
- CMOS compatibility
- Low power consumption

## Timing Capacitor
Selected to achieve the target clock frequency range for:
- Manual debugging
- Normal CPU operation
